@lang en
IMPORT `nd67-annex6-table`

-- Decree 67/2023/NĐ-CP, Article 12(2): the insurer's duties within 1 hour and within 24 hours
-- of receiving notice of an accident, as regulative rules.
--
-- THE CLOCK OF THIS MODULE IS HOURS, counted from the moment the insurer receives the notice
-- of the accident (time 0 of every trace). `WITHIN 1` is one hour; `WITHIN 24` is 24 hours.
-- Nothing in the language records the unit: only this comment and the BECAUSE strings say so.
-- A deadline is inclusive: an act at exactly 1 (hour) is in time; at 1.25 it is late.
-- Fork F26: both periods run from the receipt of the notice; the sentence opens "Khi nhận được
-- thông báo về tai nạn" and names no other anchor for the 24 hours.
-- DECREE 220/2026 replaces "người thứ ba" with "bên thứ ba" in this clause (the persons the
-- insurer must work with); no period and no duty changes: one rule answers for both vintages.

§ `Article 12(2) — within 1 hour, and within 24 hours`

-- src:310 | 2. Khi nhận được thông báo về tai nạn, trong vòng 1 giờ doanh nghiệp bảo
-- src:311 | hiểm phải hướng dẫn bên mua bảo hiểm, người được bảo hiểm các biện pháp bảo
-- src:312 | đảm an toàn, đề phòng hạn chế thiệt hại về người và tài sản, hướng dẫn hồ sơ, thủ
-- src:313 | tục yêu cầu bồi thường bảo hiểm; phối hợp chặt chẽ với bên mua bảo hiểm, người
-- src:314 | được bảo hiểm, người thứ ba và các bên liên quan trong vòng 24 giờ tổ chức thực
-- src:315 | hiện việc giám định tổn thất xác định nguyên nhân và mức độ tổn thất làm căn cứ
-- src:316 | giải quyết bồi thường bảo hiểm.
-- src:nd220-2026-congbao-367:172 | Điều 9. Thay thế một số cụm từ tại Nghị định số 67/2023/NĐ-CP
-- src:nd220-2026-congbao-367:173 | 1. Thay thế cụm từ “người thứ ba” bằng cụm từ “bên thứ ba” tại khoản 5
-- src:nd220-2026-congbao-367:174 | Điều 3, Điều 5, điểm a khoản 1 Điều 7, điểm đ khoản 2 Điều 10, khoản 2 và
-- src:nd220-2026-congbao-367:175 | điểm a khoản 6 Điều 12, khoản 5 Điều 13, Điều 41, khoản 1 và điểm đ khoản 2

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(2), first limb
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party to the claim` `An act under Articles 10 and 12`
`Article 12(2) — within 1 hour, the insurer must guide the buyer and the insured` MEANS
    PARTY  `the insurer`
    MUST   `guide the buyer on safety and on the claim file and procedure`
    WITHIN 1
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   BREACH BY `the insurer`
           BECAUSE "Article 12(2): the insurer did not guide the buyer and the insured within 1 hour of receiving notice of the accident"

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(2), second limb
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party to the claim` `An act under Articles 10 and 12`
`Article 12(2) — within 24 hours, the insurer must organise the loss assessment` MEANS
    PARTY  `the insurer`
    MUST   `organise the loss assessment`
    WITHIN 24
    HENCE  FULFILLED
    LEST   BREACH BY `the insurer`
           BECAUSE "Article 12(2): the insurer did not organise the loss assessment within 24 hours of receiving notice of the accident"

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(2)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party to the claim` `An act under Articles 10 and 12`
`Article 12(2) — the insurer's duties on receiving notice of an accident` MEANS
        `Article 12(2) — within 1 hour, the insurer must guide the buyer and the insured`
    RAND
        `Article 12(2) — within 24 hours, the insurer must organise the loss assessment`

-- The same two periods as tests a caller can ask of recorded times (hours after the notice).
@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(2)
GIVEN `hours after the notice` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 12(2) — guidance given this many hours after the notice is in time` `hours after the notice` MEANS
    `hours after the notice` AT MOST 1

@ref Decree 67/2023 Article 12(2)
GIVEN `hours after the notice` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Article 12(2) — an assessment organised this many hours after the notice is in time` `hours after the notice` MEANS
    `hours after the notice` AT MOST 24

§§ `Article 12(2) — illustrations`

-- Guidance after 1 hour exactly, the assessment organised after 24 hours exactly: both in time.
#TRACE `Article 12(2) — the insurer's duties on receiving notice of an accident` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the insurer` DOES `guide the buyer on safety and on the claim file and procedure` AT 1
    PARTY `the insurer` DOES `organise the loss assessment` AT 24

-- Guidance after 1 hour 15 minutes: late.
#TRACE `Article 12(2) — within 1 hour, the insurer must guide the buyer and the insured` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the insurer` DOES `guide the buyer on safety and on the claim file and procedure` AT 1.25

-- The assessment organised after 25 hours: late.
#TRACE `Article 12(2) — within 24 hours, the insurer must organise the loss assessment` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the insurer` DOES `organise the loss assessment` AT 25
